<!-- The vanilla unbuilt Pyre (chapel courtyard campfire) with the campfire moved from
     statics to units: a static is not a scene unit (FetchAllUnits never returns it), a
     unit can be hidden, so the campaign portal can stand in its place (CampaignModule.as).
     Base copy: pyre_tier_0.pfb.orig, compared by the build.py override check. -->
